# fifo_child_page_lists: Rings over page lists: one page; three contiguous pages; three scattered pages, each followed in guest memory by a page of 0xff. On the scattered ring, a barrier whose index straddles each page boundary and the ring's end reads 0 (a read of the physically next page would give 0xffff.... and fault), and a header straddles the end. readCount runs on past the ring's size.
